# CONSTRUCTED SYNTHETIC OUTPUT — not a real ORCA run.
# ACP2 A-16a negative fixture: two imaginary modes at native printed indices 6
# and 7.  A first-order saddle candidate requires exactly one imaginary mode,
# so this output must refute that candidate.  Numeric values are illustrative
# and make no claim about any real transition state.
# Written in ORCA 5.x text shape so the existing frequency parser is exercised.

